{"time": 1768913898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "352427728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1453970436]*点点头，收好名片"}
