{"time": 1768921181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1736792453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（让我安妮出马吧）"}
{"time": 1768921195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "633200898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（安妮草，安妮是高中生吧"}
{"time": 1768921205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "611600062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（懂不懂70信用jk，手上有一个大庄园的含金量）"}
{"time": 1768921208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1886648190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（草）"}
{"time": 1768921228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "489578862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（跑了个团，把庄园收了，信用直接涨了30）"}
{"time": 1768921232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136452903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（很难蚌）"}
{"time": 1768921233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136259964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "(草"}
{"time": 1768921243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "22467179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（草）"}
{"time": 1768921259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "86205627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“哎，算了，我本来就不是来赚钱的。。。”"}
{"time": 1768921286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1024713234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "妮可拿出两张100美金的钞票吗"}
{"time": 1768921425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073321196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "*保安大叔以令人惊叹的，不属于他的年龄该有的速度接过这两张钞票，你甚至连他放到哪里的动作都没看清，但只有空落落的手和又干瘪了一点的钱包告诉你刚刚这一切都是真实发生过的。“欸，，，我好像是想起来有这号人。来来来，外面冷，进屋说。”他招呼你们进保安亭"}
{"time": 1768921439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "502710519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“是这样的呢，毕竟你不是直接接触生产线的员工。所以的话，我们如果能跟工地的工头交流的话就更好了。嗯？”"}
{"time": 1768921448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1756262698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（也行）"}
{"time": 1768921459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909944111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“谢谢谢谢”*笑笑进来保安亭"}
{"time": 1768921537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636992813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“你们要找的那个，是布莱克对吧。惹是生非的混蛋，被老板开除了一脚踹走了”"}
{"time": 1768921597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1354088796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“好家伙。。。可以详细为我们说一说吗”"}
{"time": 1768921603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "202087338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“也不知道那小子干了什么，估计是赌博了，欠了一屁股债，甚至他还欠老板的钱。真不知道这小子都借了多少。”"}
{"time": 1768921630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "957502499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“被开除是什么时候的事？”"}
{"time": 1768921644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239967054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“但是老板怎么会没事给员工借钱啊。。。”"}
{"time": 1768921655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1594147353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“不止我们厂的人，他估计也在外面借了一大堆。隔三岔五就有人上来讨债。最开始那段时间甚至影响公司运营了”"}
{"time": 1768921667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "381410404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“。。。厉害，”"}
{"time": 1768921674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936614133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“差不多有个半年时间吧”"}
{"time": 1768921705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "540653883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“居然是已经半年前吗，那可真是。”"}
{"time": 1768921707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200490696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“估计是没钱了呗，能扯上关系的人都借一遍。借的时候说的花言巧语，再要债可就难如登天了”"}
{"time": 1768921718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123100133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "他失踪是什么时候的事？"}
{"time": 1768921722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2107599327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“原来已经这么久之前了”"}
{"time": 1768921800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264717028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（两个月钱失踪的吗）"}
{"time": 1768921838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2021559354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“这和他最近当扒手的事迹对得上啊。。。但是6个月以前他就不在这里了”"}
{"time": 1768921871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1262978345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（两周？）"}
{"time": 1768921918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895327105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“那么他到底是为了什么要借这么多的钱呢？”"}
{"time": 1768921937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1442103422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "如果他是碎尸案的凶手的话，那些钱为什么又会到那个人身上"}
{"time": 1768921952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655669613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“那我怎么知道”保安摆摆手"}
{"time": 1768922039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688324222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“说的也是呢。。。那么附近大桥下的那个凶杀案呢？你对此知道多少，和这个工厂的人们有关系吗”"}
{"time": 1768922046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "545305756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（我们要不要去找老板问问）"}
{"time": 1768922079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "292800131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“啥凶杀案，我不知道”"}
{"time": 1768922084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "350844515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“没听说过\n”"}
{"time": 1768922101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "760582247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“这样。。。”妮可遗憾地眯起了眼睛。。。"}
{"time": 1768922214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "175114093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“那么，我们可以与你们的老板咨询有关事项吗，以及到你们厂子里讨债的人里有没有什么令人印象深刻的家伙。\n这家伙现在处于失踪状态而有人委托寻找，而这些想必是最直接的行踪线索了。”"}
{"time": 1768922322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325789067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“这个不行。虽然你们是侦探，但是很遗憾，要是所有人都因为这点小事去找我们老板的话，那我这个门卫就不用干了。欠了一屁股债的混蛋，死有余辜，谁有心情关心他啊”"}
{"time": 1768922363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144551934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“那边有个员工休息室，我可以监督去你们看看。看完了就走吧”"}
{"time": 1768922408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "222361133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "*他抬手指了指，从保安室往楼里走不远处有一间屋子，那里应该就是所说的员工休息室"}
{"time": 1768922426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "689927906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“嗯。。。”"}
{"time": 1768922449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868760222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "老板的话，倒是说不定有自己的名片和招商热线呢，我们也许可以通过这个进行联系"}
{"time": 1768922480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172409808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "妮可不自觉地裹紧了一些自己的冬装，然后"}
{"time": 1768922482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "233961855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（走呗）"}
{"time": 1768922486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642055591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "前往员工休息室"}
{"time": 1768922498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322367668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "（其他人呢"}
{"time": 1768922504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560891496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "*跟"}
{"time": 1768922573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795549410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "*在保安的引导和监视下，你们来到了旁边的休息室。"}
{"time": 1768922607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1626610560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "他带你们进门，然后突然夸张的一捂肚子“哎呦，肚子疼，上个厕所”"}
{"time": 1768922623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "195579976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "溜到不知道哪里上厕所去了"}
{"time": 1768922628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767209825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“是不是和那些家伙不对付啊。”"}
{"time": 1768922644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "281254654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（不赖）"}
{"time": 1768922655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329013463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "妮可提高了警惕。。。"}
{"time": 1768922655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "164658891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "*看他走开了，四处看看环境"}
{"time": 1768922669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1484781616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "有两名员工在角落里面闲聊着什么，其中一人手里拿着份像是报告的东西，见你们进来他们马上压低了声音。员工休息室两旁是密密麻麻的柜子，看上去有些年头了，上面依次排着编号。"}
{"time": 1768922683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "721072765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（等等，我们是不是可以就地展开调查）"}
