{"time": 1768923556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809821528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（哎，coc的信用都是虚的（）"}
{"time": 1768923573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2099325544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "妮可一边清扫一边说到：“威廉先生呐，你现在可是吃两个美少女的软饭的家伙了啊，还请务必努力一点”"}
{"time": 1768923580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1353785175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（666）"}
{"time": 1768923582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597635050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "说罢妮可把那些危险的化学物质清理了"}
{"time": 1768923594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403788924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“软饭在哪啊喂”*吐槽"}
{"time": 1768923633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1158923003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“这两位先生，请问你们认识布莱克吗”*出示名片，手机打开布莱克的照片"}
{"time": 1768923634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472067357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "（总之 给动作）"}
{"time": 1768923636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034845329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "（你看我们两个花钱才进来的）"}
{"time": 1768923648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298080427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”如果威廉先生能够从他们嘴里套出来东西，我可以喂你吃晚饭哦“"}
{"time": 1768923656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1041665451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“这谁？草，那傻逼”"}
{"time": 1768923678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968679573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“这逼不是还欠你钱来着”"}
{"time": 1768923709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1340678289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“是啊，借完钱就和他那狗友鬼混”"}
{"time": 1768923718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "739746307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“这个入还失踪了，有人委托我调查，这不正好。找到他我把下落告诉你们”"}
{"time": 1768923740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "326326724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“他失踪了？草！”"}
{"time": 1768923749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261144713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“那tmd我的钱怎么办”"}
{"time": 1768923783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1783019840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“好说，能不能和我说说他的事情，作为谢礼。找到他就把下落偷偷告诉你们”*凑近他们小声说"}
{"time": 1768923811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "449239107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "（好一招驱虎吞狼）"}
{"time": 1768923874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800153464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "那两个员工听到这话  警惕的扫了一下你们浑身上下“喂，我说，你们不是这厂里的人吧”"}
{"time": 1768923909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629588993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "*再次给他们看看名片"}
{"time": 1768923925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "328733297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“我们正在调查他的下落”"}
{"time": 1768924024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723474059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“嘛，这家伙要是找不到的话就再也还不了钱了呢，根据我们的理解他完全就是跑路了，我们也是被一个苦命的债主委托来的呐”"}
{"time": 1768924038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472632766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“切，侦探啊，是哪个有钱人被那家伙借了一大笔钱来雇你们的啊。告诉你们也无妨，那么多人来来回回找他要债都没要到，我看你们也差不多”"}
{"time": 1768924078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638066141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1258719565"}, "sender": {"id": "1258719565", "name": "雪狼"}, "message": "“他到底是怎么找那么多人借那么多钱干什么的啊。。。”"}
{"time": 1768924167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509749636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“谁知道呢，要不要打赌”"}
{"time": 1768924221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1531142196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“那个家伙之前就老老实实的上班，下班喝酒吹牛逼，天天和他那狐朋狗友，特别是那个谁，那个比尔鬼混。后来也不知道怎么了，估计是赌了犯病了，欠了一屁股债。把厂里全借了一圈了被开除滚蛋了”"}
{"time": 1768924272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703689239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "*回忆当时案发现场看到的赃物有没有水泥厂的证件"}
{"time": 1768924300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240655449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“比尔吗，那家伙带坏他的？能不能说一下他的事情”"}
{"time": 1768924361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1527355477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "“那家伙是个黑人商贩，在熏华路开了家当铺。他穿着皱皱的灰色大衣，跟个老鼠似的，之前他们两个好像经常一块叼个烟去喝酒。”"}
{"time": 1768924377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712801909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1985245608"}, "sender": {"id": "1985245608", "name": "洛绫飞羽"}, "message": "”他不是这厂里的员工，我们也知道的不多“"}
{"time": 1768924378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665787223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（你可以发现一些钱包，有男款的\n女款的，新的旧的，看上去就像是里面的钱被人粗\n暴地拿出来之后就随便藏在这里。其中还有一个华\n丽的方形小盒子，看上去十分高端，与周围显得格\n格不入。）"}
